WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.719
Many learners use phones without guidance. Teachers can make a big difference.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:11.274
Keep personal information private: address, phone number, and school photos.

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:14.900
People online may not be who they say they are.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.376
Be kind, and think before you post. Posts can last forever.

00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:23.475
And always tell a trusted adult if something feels wrong.

00:00:24.020 --> 00:00:32.867
Before you move on, check: Teach the six key messages. Run one role-play activity. Ask permission before posting learners' photos.

00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:36.189
In the next lesson: Low-data teaching.
